    await insert_lesson(m4, "Your Placement Result", "article", {"body": "# Your Placement\n\nLook at your answers across all three sections. Here's where to start:\n\n## If you answered mostly in the first two options of each question:\n**Start with Course 1: AI for the Exhausted**\nYou need relevance and safety before anything else.\n\n## If you answered mostly in the middle options:\n**Start with Course 2: The Reference Interview vs. The Chatbot**\nYou're ready to test your judgment against the machine.\n\n## If you answered mostly in the last two options:\n**Start with Course 3: The Scanner & The Stack**\nYou're ready to build, and the library needs you to.\n\n## If your answers were all over the place:\n**Start with Course 1, but pair up with someone from Course 2.**\nPeer support bridges the gap.\n\n---\n\n## The Override\nIf you *want* a harder course, take it. Adult autonomy means self-placement. This survey is a suggestion, not a gate.\n\nYou're in charge of your pace. Always."}, 3, 10, 3)

